,"isSectionContent":false,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"mobile":{"height":"117px","top":"-125px","left":"2px","width":"438px"},"desktop":{"width":"2501px","height":"117px","background-color":"rgba(71,67,67,1)","position":"absolute","top":"0px","left":"-15px"}},"data":{"component":null},"children":["silex-id-1604062398148-6","silex-id-1604062127123-3"],"pageNames":[],"classList":[],"link":null,"enableEdit":false,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":true,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"innerHtml":""},{"id":"silex-id-1604062127123-3","type":"html-element","alt":null,"title":null,"isSectionContent":false,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"mobile":{},"desktop":{"width":"149px","height":"74px","background-color":"transparent","position":"absolute","top":"24px","left":"1418px","opacity":"0.5"}},"data":{"component":null},"children":[],"pageNames":[],"classList":[],"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"innerHtml":"<button onclick=\"goBack()\">Back to <p>Digi Card Therapy</p></button>\r\n<script>\r\nfunction goBack() {\r\n  window.history.back();\r\n}\r\n</script>"},{"id":"silex-id-1604062398148-6","type":"html-element","alt":null,"title":null,"isSectionContent":false,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"mobile":{},"desktop":{"width":"245px","height":"105px","background-color":"transparent","position":"absolute","top":"4px","left":"27px","opacity":null}},"data":{"component":null},"children":[],"pageNames":[],"classList":[],"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"innerHtml":"<button onclick=\"goBack()\" \r\nstyle=\"background-color:transparent;border:none;box-shadow:none\">\r\n\r\n<img width=\"178\" height=\"100\" src=\"LOGO%20small.png\" alt=\"logo\">\r\n</button>\r\n<script>\r\nfunction goBack() {\r\n  window.history.back();\r\n}\r\n</script>"},{"id":"silex-id-1604063015245-7","type":"text-element","alt":null,"title":null,"isSectionContent":false,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"mobile":{},"desktop":{"width":"358px","height":"1820px","position":"absolute","top":"93px","left":"328px"}},"data":{"component":null},"children":[],"pageNames":[],"classList":[],"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"innerHtml":"\n\n\n\n<p>There are two more backgrounds in the pack that can be used:</p>\n<p>1) Bull's eye</p>\n<p>2) Matrix</p>\n<p><b>Bull's Eye: </b>Using the bull's eye background, we represent a current situation and where you like to aim for.</p>\n<p>For example, choose 5 cards that represent a relationship, and then place them on the bull's eye. The center represents where you want to be and the farther away from the center – the farther you are from where you want to be.</p>\n<p><b>The matrix</b> can be used for sorting. Sorting helps us become aware and identifying different issues. You can use the Matrix background and sort by different categories. For example place cards in different quadrants that represent:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>What is important to you</li>\n<li>Feelings, thoughts, feelings or memories [internal things] that appear when you consider what is important.</li>\n<li>What do you do to avoid these feelings / thoughts / feelings</li>\n<li>How will you react - when these thoughts / feelings / beliefs will not affect you.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Combinations of decks: (pictures, entries, quotes)</p>\n<p>Create a vision board for yourself!</p>\n<p>What is a vision? A vision is an image that a person sees in his mind's eye, in his imagination, in his dream.</p>\n<p>Vision is where we want to go. The best place we can imagine for ourselves in all aspects of life or in specific areas. In order to reach it, it is worth first of all ... to define it, in a clear and unambiguous way, to really see in our mind's eye our best imagination-</p>\n<p>How does it look? What will be there? What will our house look like? How will our meaningful relationships be? What assets will we have (spiritual, personal, economic).</p>\n<p>Imagine that you were transported into the your vision. Describe in as much detail as possible and once in a while update it.</p>\n<p>When you have a vision, it is easier to find the ways to get there! A vision can provide the motivation and fuel for the long journey.</p>\n<p>Choose values, a quote and a picture that describe the place you want to be and the way you want to get there</p>\n<p>You could print your vision board and hang it up in a visible place for a daily reminder 😊</p>\n\n\n\n"},{"id":"silex-id-1604420896457-0","type":"text-element","alt":null,"title":null,"isSectionContent":false,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"mobile":{},"desktop":{"width":"322px","height":"3324px","position":"absolute","top":"77px","left":"-1px"}},"data":{"component":null},"children":[],"pageNames":[],"classList":[],"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"innerHtml":"\n\n\n\n<p>A picture is worth a thousand words ... sometimes just one word sometimes several. A picture can accurately describe a situation from which the words eluded. Sometimes it evokes a dream, a belief, a reminder of what is important.</p>\n<p>An image can bring to our awareness beliefs, feelings or dreams that words could not elicit.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;The same picture will tell remind everyone of something different</p>\n<p>It can be a great reminder not to assume what the other is thinking, that the perspectives through which we look at the world are different.</p>\n<h3>How to play picture cards? How ever you choose😊!</h3>\n<p>Try out different methods, be playful, find what suits you best.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<b>Here are some of our ideas:</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Choose a card that describes the situation you are in</li>\n<li>Now choose a card that describes the place you want to be and choose a card that describes your future you want</li>\n<li>Choose a card that represents a problem you are dealing with right now. Choose a card that can represent a solution to the problem.</li>\n<li>Choose a card that describes the emotion that arises as a result of the problem you are dealing with.</li>\n<li>Is there a card that describes the way you want to behave regarding a problem you are dealing with?</li>\n<li>Which card motivates you? What do you see there?</li>\n<li>What card it significant card for you, what does it evoke?</li>\n<li>Which card makes you happy? What's in it?</li>\n<li>What card represents a meaningful relationship for you? Describe what's similar? What's different? Which card would your partner choose?</li>\n<li>Which card is inspiring?</li>\n<li>Choose a card that describes a particular pattern you are stuck in.</li>\n<li>Choosing a card that describes a safe and positive place for you.</li>\n<li>Choose a card that describes your strengths and resources</li>\n<li>Choose a card that represents a something that is holding you back.</li>\n<li>Choose a card that energises you.</li>\n<li>Choose a card that represents a new start</li>\n<li>Select a card that represents the change you want</li></ul><h2>Tell me a story<br></h2><p>Choose 5-9 cards. Tell as story using the cards.<br>In what way is the person in the story similar to you? In what is he or she different?</p><p>Could the story end differently? What would need to change for the new ending to happen?</p>\n\n\n\n"},{"id":"silex-id-1604420973126-1","type":"text-element","alt":null,"title":null,"isSectionContent":false,"visibility":{"desktop":true,"mobile":true},"style":{"mobile":{},"desktop":{"width":"312px","height":"60px","position":"absolute","top":"11px","left":"170px"}},"data":{"component":null},"children":[],"pageNames":[],"classList":[],"link":null,"enableEdit":true,"enableDrag":true,"enableDrop":false,"enableResize":{"top":true,"bottom":true,"left":true,"right":true},"selected":false,"useMinHeight":true,"innerHtml":"\n\n<h1>Photo Card Deck</h1>\n\n"}]}